Institute, Boston, Massachusetts, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Stead W", "lastName": "Stead", "firstName": "William", "initials": "W", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-5048-9540"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Vanderbilt University, Nashville, Tennessee, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Sullivan K", "lastName": "Sullivan", "firstName": "Kevin", "initials": "K", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University of Virginia, Charlottesville, Virginia, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Van Houweling D", "lastName": "Van Houweling", "firstName": "Douglas", "initials": "D", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University of Michigan, Ann Arbor, Michigan, USA."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-5048-9540"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-9340-7189"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3325-793X"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "1", "volume": "22", "journalIssueId": 2245881, "dateOfPublication": "2015 Jan", "monthOfPublication": 1, "yearOfPublication": 2015, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "J Am Med Inform Assoc", "title": "Journal of the American Medical Informatics Association : JAMIA", "essn": "1527-974X", "issn": "1067-5027", "nlmid": "9430800", "isoabbreviation": "J Am Med Inform Assoc"}, "printPublicationDate": "2015-01-01"}, "pubYear": "2015", "pageInfo": "43-50", "abstractText": "<h4>Objective</h4>The capability to share data, and harness its potential to generate knowledge rapidly and inform decisions, can have transformative effects that improve health. The infrastructure to achieve this goal at scale--marrying technology, process, and policy--is commonly referred to as the Learning Health System (LHS). Achieving an LHS raises numerous scientific challenges.<h4>Materials and methods</h4>The National Science Foundation convened an invitational workshop to identify the fundamental scientific and engineering research challenges to achieving a national-scale LHS. The workshop was planned by a 12-member committee and ultimately engaged 45 prominent researchers spanning multiple disciplines over 2 days in Washington, DC on 11-12 April 2013.<h4>Results</h4>The workshop participants collectively identified 106 research questions organized around four system-level requirements that a high-functioning LHS must satisfy. The workshop participants also identified a new cross-disciplinary integrative science of cyber-social ecosystems that will be required to address these challenges.<h4>Conclusions</h4>The intellectual merit and potential broad impacts of the innovations that will be driven by investments in an LHS are of great potential significance. The specific research questions that emerged from the workshop, alongside the potential for diverse communities to assemble to address them through a 'new science of learning systems', create an important agenda for informatics and related disciplines.", "affiliation": "University of Michigan, Ann Arbor, Michigan, USA.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["Conference Proceedings", "research-article", "Research Support, U.S. Gov't, Non-P.H.S."]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Medical Records Systems, Computerized", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "OG", "qualifierName": "organization & administration"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Information Dissemination"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Computer Security"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Information Systems", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "OG", "qualifierName": "organization & administration"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Delivery of Health Care, Integrated"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "United States"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Databases as Topic"}]}, "keywordList": {"keyword": ["Population Health", "Research Agenda", "Learning Health System", "System Science"]}, "subsetList": {"subset": [{"code": "IM", "name": "Index Medicus"}]}, "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Subscription required", "availabilityCode": "S", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1136/amiajnl-2014-002977"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "html", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC4433378"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC4433378?pdf=render"}]}, "isOpenAccess": "Y", "inEPMC": "Y", "inPMC": "Y", "citedByCount": 322, "hasReferences": "Y", "hasTextMinedTerms": "Y", "hasDbCrossReferences": "N", "hasPDF": "Y", "hasBook": "N", "hasSuppl": "N", "hasLabsLinks": "Y", "hasData": "Y", "license": "cc by-nc", "authMan": "N", "epmcAuthMan": "N", "nihAuthMan": "N", "hasTMAccessionNumbers": "Y", "tmAccessionTypeList": {"accessionType": ["doi"]}, "dateOfCompletion": "2015-05-18", "dateOfCreation": "2014-10-25", "dateOfRevision": "2026-01-28", "electronicPublicationDate": "2014-10-23", "firstPublicationDate": "2014-10-23", "firstIndexDate": "2014-10-25", "fullTextReceivedDate": "2020-07-10", "hasEvaluations": "N"}]}}